@startuml
title Timing Diagram - Packet TTL During Routing

robust "Packet" as Packet
concise "Route Progress" as Route

@0
Packet is Created
Route is "No route"

@1
Packet is RoutingRequested
Route is "Route calculated"

@2
Packet is InTransit
Route is "At source"

@3
Packet is InTransit
Route is "Hop 1, TTL decreased"

@4
Packet is InTransit
Route is "Hop 2, TTL decreased"

@5
Packet is Delivered
Route is "Destination reached"

@enduml
